   <section class="surface sources workspace" data-view="sources" id="sources" aria-labelledby="sources-title"><p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH / PRIMARY SOURCES</p><h2 id="sources-title">The work already done<br>sets the standard.</h2><div class="source-list"><a href="https://superintelligence.jpl.nasa.gov/public/projects/orbital-express/"><span>01 / JPL · ORBITAL EXPRESS</span><h3>Replacement has flight heritage.</h3><p>Battery and CPU transfers were demonstrated in 2007. Replacement itself is not a CARTAN invention.</p><b aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></b></a><a href="https://www.mdpi.com/2673-4591/133/1/194"><span>02 / SPACE USB · 2026</span><h3>Interfaces and test benches exist.</h3><p>Mechanical capture and electrical checks are established work. Confidential results limit public comparison.</p><b aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></b></a><a href="https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20210024253"><span>03 / NASA · PASS · 2022</span><h3>Recovery is an existing research field.</h3><p>Supervised assembly explicitly includes planning and error recovery. The exact CARTAN gap remains unproven.</p><b aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></b></a><a href="https://www.gao.gov/products/gao-25-107555"><span>04 / GAO · JULY 2025</span><h3>Technical value needs a mission.</h3><p>Fragmented demand and adoption barriers make a real operator requirement essential.</p><b aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></b></a></div><p class="source-limit">These are source-reported findings, not independent replication or endorsement of CARTAN.</p></section>
