+# Interior asset and source provenance
+
+The existing `asset-registry.json` remains the historical intake record. This
+supplement changes current usage only; no asset rights or approvals are expanded.
+
+| Artifact | Basis | Use and boundary |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Original hero, two opening-frame WebPs, mobile delivery video, full silent film, logo | Existing approved checkout `dcc8d8e`; 28 preservation checks in `qa/interior-2026-11-23/preservation.json` | Unchanged opening/media bytes and behavior. No re-edit, sound or generation. |
+| Assembly concept image | Existing `assets/scenes/assembly.png`, unchanged | Longer horizon only. Generated, unvalidated concept; never geometry or a physical outcome. |
+| Old service-bay still | Preserved original and package asset | Removed from the interior and its early preload. The depicted mechanism is not a basis for interface hotspots. |
+| Module schematic | Original code in `index.html`, `module-drawing`; explicit SVG polygons/paths in a 660×500 drawing coordinate system | Generic host, cartridge and independent support relationships. Coordinates are graphic layout units, not dimensions. Dashed regions locate functions, not sensor observations or specified latch/electrical topology. No exploded kinematics or engineering mesh. |
+| Interface schematic | Original code in `index.html`, `interface-drawing`, 480×110 layout units | Two relationships meet the module. Lines are not measured load paths or an electrical circuit. Full text equivalent and role/title supplied. |
+| `schematic-review.svg/.png` | Extracted from the module SVG and rendered locally with `rsvg-convert` | Inspected drawing-only QA artifact. **Not a browser screenshot.** Its selected outline and labels were inspected; whole-page layout was not. |
+| Partial/locked comparison | Byte-verified v1 `run-ui-fixture-001`, final belief entry at synthetic t=1 | Exactly two authored host values. Scene remains unchanged; no probability or real-world release recommendation. Reachability remains unverified. |
+| Observation and authored truth | Same fixture's distinct observation/truth/command series | Stale acknowledgement, sampled/received times, source ID, hold command and author-assigned truth stay distinct. No measured voltage trace is supplied. |
+| Research sources | Existing four public primary-source links and source-reported summaries | Preserved presentation scope; no fresh scientific result or Engine study imported. |
+
+The raw fixture and frozen schema source commit are linked at the point of use.
+The public package includes neither this provenance note nor private source paths.
+Geometry assets, load limits and measured outcomes are still missing/unknown/
+unmeasured as specified. No 3D runtime or additional external asset was justified.
+
+`interior-schematic-v1.json` pins each original SVG fragment by SHA-256 under
+`explanatory-schematic/1.0.0`. These are presentation identities, not qualified
+geometry versions.
